                                "sense_id": "ec58c7f7-0edf-39e1-95d2-27fc7578f56f",
                                "text": "\"Look, Jim, how my fingers fidges,\" he continued in the pleading tone. \"I can't keep 'em still, not I. I haven't had a drop this blessed day. That doctor's a fool, I tell you. If I don't have a dram o' rum, Jim, I'll have the horrors...\""
